{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23794","headline":"池鹤二首 一 · 白居易","name":"池鹤二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高竹笼前无伴侣，乱鸡羣里有风标。\n低头乍恐丹砂落，晒翅常疑白雪消。\n转觉鸬鷀毛色下，苦嫌鹦鹉语声娇。\n临风一唳思何事，怅望青田云水遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}